Footage shows a series of airstrikes carried out by the Russian Aerospace Forces (VKS), as follows:
• Destruction of the command post of a unit of the Ukrainian Armed Forces’ 38th Anti-Aircraft Missile Regiment using a FAB-3000 equipped with a UMPK guidance kit in Kherson. A substation was also hit in the strike.;
• A strike with five FAB-500 bombs equipped with UMPK guidance kits against the UAV launch/control position of the 15th Separate Operational Regiment of the National Guard of Ukraine in Dobropillia.
